    "text": "Cedar Key News\nwebsite\nCedar Key\nCITY COMMISSION MET - 24 JUN 2025\nBy CKN STAFF,6 hours ago\nDISCUSSES POLICE PROTECTION, CITY HALL AUTOMATION IN BUDGET WORKSHOP. The Cedar Key Commission met on Tuesday evening, June 24, 2025, at 5 pm at City Hall in workshop mode. In attendance were Mayor Jeff Webb and Commissioners Nancy Sera, Jolie Davis, and Mel Beckham. Vice Mayor Jim Wortham was not in attendance.\nRelated Topics\nComments\nLoading editor...",
